OL,3,GNEWSAI won't apologise for hard work
OL,4,Aand ambition, says Katherine Jenkins
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatherine Jenkins has reflected on the
OL,7,F"crazy" questions she was asked by the
OL,8,Fpress as a young classical singer.
OL,10,FThe mezzo-soprano, who has had 14
OL,11,Fnumber one albums, is about to start a
OL,12,Ftour marking 25 years as one of the
OL,13,Fworld's most successful classical
OL,14,Fsingers.
OL,16,FJenkins, 46, from Neath, said she had
OL,17,F"found her own voice" and learnt to
OL,18,Ftake control of her career over the
OL,19,Fyears, adding she was often staggered
OL,20,Fby the things journalists would say to
OL,21,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
