OL,3,GNEWSAI won't apologise for hard work
OL,4,Aand ambition, says Katherine Jenkins
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I would often get asked 'who's looking
OL,7,Fafter your children?' That's crazy. You
OL,8,Fwouldn't get tenors asked that
OL,9,Fquestion," she told BBC Radio Wales.
